		(\Psi^{\infty}_0)_{\ell m}(\tau,r(\tau,\varrho)):=\beta_{\ell}\sum_{n=0}^{N_{\beta_{\ell}}}\zeta^n(1+\tau)^{-a+2iq-n\beta_{\ell}}{}_2\mathbf{F}_1\left(a,b,c_n;-\varrho\right),
